CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790155482
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AUS criticises Australia's proposed
OL,4,Aalgorithm opt-out laws as 'censorship'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has criticised Australia's
OL,7,Fproposal to give users the ability to
OL,8,Fopt out of social media algorithms,
OL,9,Fsaying it amounts to "censorship of
OL,10,Fprotected speech".
OL,12,FUnder Australia's draft digital duty of
OL,13,Fcare laws, tech firms risk hefty fines
OL,14,Fif they fail to give users the option
OL,15,Fto turn off algorithms in a bid to
OL,16,Fprotect them from harmful content.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11906
SC,0006
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790155482
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AUS criticises Australia's proposed
OL,4,Aalgorithm opt-out laws as 'censorship'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a rare submission to the proposed
OL,7,Flaws, the US embassy in Canberra said
OL,8,Fit had "serious concerns" and allowing
OL,9,Fthe government to "enforce vague
OL,10,Fdefinitions of 'harm'" would lead to
OL,11,F"viewpoint-based censorship".
OL,13,FAustralian Prime Minister Anthony
OL,14,FAlbanese said the legislation was not
OL,15,Fabout giving governments control but
OL,16,Fgiving it back to individuals.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
